<div class="paragraph">
<p>To fetch the content of the URL invoke the following:</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>$ curl -v <a href="http://127.0.0.1:8080" class="bare">http://127.0.0.1:8080</a>
*   Trying 127.0.0.1&#8230;&#8203;
* Connected to 127.0.0.1 (127.0.0.1) port 8080 (#0)
&gt; GET / HTTP/1.1
&gt; User-Agent: curl/7.41.0
&gt; Host: 127.0.0.1:8080
